  "question": "Which nature reserve is closest when moving in the east direction from Hyatt Centric, New York, NY?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-74.007746 40.705205)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois,origin\nWHERE pois.leisure = 'nature_reserve'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 67.5 AND 112.5\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> origin.geometry ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
